00:13:51.658 --> 00:13:52.680
Yeah.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:54.330
- I mean, when we were all just spinning

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:58.320
in our heads wondering,
will this world fall apart?

00:13:58.320 --> 00:14:01.890
I found again, the small
